#: ../../source/quality/index.md:1 83fc704fb5eb411eb3d4c5c75b69e2ad
msgid "Quality Metrics & Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:3 d4cefc00098846d0b55b0def1025a05d
msgid "`findfmt` is engineered under the strictest software quality standards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:5 e95457b3a5ee49aabbe7947ea44404b9
msgid "1. Code Quality Standards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:7 25f7eb0a494c454a94cda7f526789f20
msgid ""
"**100% Code Coverage**: Enforced through `pytest-cov` and Codecov CI "
"checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:8 e5ffdc0610d543e397dce947d4c0f6e9
msgid ""
"**Strict Static Typing**: Verified with `ty` in pedantic mode (`all = "
"\"error\"`) and `pyproject.toml` configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:10 c16adc601a194e90930b0ae28a92d820
msgid ""
"**Ruff Strictness**: Formatted and linted using `ruff` with `ALL` rules "
"selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:11 73fe35cf96124366ab7f55c7f4960e7b
msgid "**Cyclomatic Complexity**: Monitored using `radon` and capped via `xenon`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:12 174172abc94f483181b8c6ab6df5939a
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Documentation Completeness**: Monitored via `interrogate` ensuring 100%"
" docstring coverage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:13 39c1ae3e69b247f69047b9475b6dd103
msgid ""
"**Prose & Style Linting**: Enforced on all Markdown documentation using "
"Vale with Google and Proselint style standards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:16 99d1fef3605f467a950610dd00f9a54a
msgid "2. Traversal Complexity Optimization & Performance Baselines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:18 effb3769e3d644f08caa26f5f63ab15a
msgid ""
"Repository traversal performs early pruning of `.gitignore` hierarchies "
"to prevent recursing into expansive unneeded directory trees such as "
"`node_modules`, `.venv`, or compilation artifact directories in $O(1)$ "
"time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:22 4fccc2132e7d4b3a8503177d3dd20dfc
msgid ""
"Official v1.0.0 benchmarks establish traversal throughput exceeding 3,000"
" files/second on standard hierarchies and confirm bounded $O(1)$ memory "
"usage across streaming output formatters (`text`, `jsonl`, `tsv`, `csv`)."
" See [Performance Architecture & Benchmarks](performance.md) for full "
"topology baselines and regression testing procedures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:27 48237215a90e435f90cb13166a5112a8
msgid "3. Python Runtime Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/index.md:29 b21cf5c70cd044c8b83c116737ab0b91
msgid ""
"`findfmt` officially supports Python 3.11 through 3.15, with automated CI"
" matrices testing Ubuntu, macOS, and Windows. A non-gating `3.16-dev` job"
" gives early warning for the next Python release. See the complete "
"analysis and version matrix:"
msgstr ""
